It runs trellis.cpp (https://github.com/pwilkin/trellis.cpp, MIT License), a C++/GGML port of
Microsoft TRELLIS.2 (https://github.com/microsoft/TRELLIS.2, MIT License). The trellis.cpp release
binaries (v0.8.1) and the GGUF weights are not included in this plugin; they are downloaded at prepare
time from the trellis.cpp GitHub release and from ilintar/trellis2-gguf and vegax87/Pixal3D on Hugging Face,
each pinned by sha256.

Third-party models used by the downloaded weights:
- TRELLIS.2-4B (Microsoft) - MIT License
- Pixal3D (TencentARC) - MIT License
- DINOv3 ViT-L/16 (Meta) - DINOv3 License, https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov3/blob/main/LICENSE.md
- BiRefNet (ZhengPeng7) - MIT License
